{
  "category": "Gas Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Almost invisible, this gaseous POKéMON cloaks the target and puts it to sleep without notice.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost invisible, this gaseous POKéMON cloaks the target and puts it to sleep without notice.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Said to appear in decrepit, deserted buildings. It has no real shape as it appears to be made of a gas.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its thin body is made of gas. It can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It wraps its opponent in its gas- like body, slowly weakening its prey by poisoning it through the skin.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "GASTLY is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this POKéMON cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "GASTLY is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this POKéMON cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When exposed to a strong wind, a GASTLY’s gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "A being that exists as a thin gas. It can topple an Indian elephant by enveloping the prey in two seconds.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost invisible, this gaseous POKéMON cloaks the target and puts it to sleep without notice.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon’s body is 95% made up of gases, which are blown away by strong gusts of wind.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Pokémon born from poison gases. It defeats even the largest foes by enveloping them in gas.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is made of gas. Despite lacking substance, it can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
