      "text": "Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gastly is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this Pokémon cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gastly is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this Pokémon cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Should a strange light be seen flickering in an abandoned building, Gastly is lurking there.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although Gastly is barely visible, when it’s near, a faint sweet smell lingers.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s said that gas emanating from a graveyard was possessed by the grievances of the deceased and thus became a Pokémon.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Poisonous gas comprises 95% of its body. It’s said that the remaining 5% is made up of the souls of those who died from the gas.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Said to appear in decrepit, deserted buildings. It has no real shape, as it appears to be made of a gas.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Said to appear in decrepit, deserted buildings. It has no real shape, as it appears to be made of a gas.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gaseous and completely impalpable. Also highly dangerous— inhaling part of its poisonous body will cause one to faint instantly.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
